    "description": "Rarely available Marina District triplex. 2 full-floor flats and a 1 bedroom garden apartment. Ideal for an owner-occupier who wants income to help with the mortgage, or for investors seeking a mostly vacant building. The vacant top-floor owners' unit features a grand front living room with a distinctive fireplace, french doors opening onto the Juliet balcony with a view of the Palace of Fine Arts, two spacious bedrooms, plus a large sunroom, formal dining room, eat-in kitchen, laundry room, and 1 full and 1 half bath. The tenant-occupied lower flat has an almost identical floor plan. The vacant 1 bed 1 bath garden apartment looks onto the lovely rear garden. Side-by-side parking for 2 cars, or 3 tandem. Beautiful location, just steps from the Palace of Fine Arts, near the Golden Gate Bridge, Marina Green, Presidio, Chestnut and Union Street shops and restaurants. Walker's and Biker's Paradise with scores of 96 walking and 95 biking."
  },
